# BackTrade Project Structure

This is a **monorepo** using pnpm workspaces and Turbo.

## Workspace Organization

```
BackTrade/
├── apps/
│   ├── api/          # Backend API (Node.js/Express)
│   └── web/          # Frontend application (React/Vite)
├── packages/
│   ├── datas/          # Shared data access layer (Prisma, repositories)
│   ├── eslint-config/  # Shared ESLint configuration
│   ├── tsconfig/       # Shared TypeScript configuration
│   ├── types/          # Shared TypeScript types and Zod schemas
│   └── utils/          # Shared utility functions
```

## Package Responsibilities

### @backtrade/datas
**DATA ACCESS ONLY** - Contains all database communication:
- ✅ Prisma schema and migrations
- ✅ Prisma client initialization
- ✅ Repository layer (pure CRUD, queries, transactions)
- ✅ Database types/models and enums
- ❌ NO business logic, workflow logic, HTTP/Express code, queue logic, auth logic, or side effects